  "details": "Hello,\n\nWe are holding and managing a group in vrchat, and are facing people that make others crash by wearing special skins or using special particles. We are wondering if this would be possible for the developers to prevent this from happening, for community conveniency.\n\nOn a personal view, I do believe this is something that can be solved by looking at the different variables that define a skin and block automatically the ones that go way above reasonable, regardless of users settings that, highly possibly, are not enough to prevent crashes due to these skins or particled all the time.\n\nThis could also be prevented by coding something that would react to sudden very high calculations causing freeze then crash, and would block the user skin or user itself if using even something else that would cause a crash.\n\nRegards,\n\nMystLgnd",
